{"id":"wb-5-289","name":"古月桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"古月桥","text":"古月桥位于中国浙江省义乌市赤岸镇雅治街村西侧，是中国现存最早的肋骨拱券结构折边形石拱桥，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n古月桥为单拱折边形石拱桥，采用纵联分节并列砌置法建造。长31.2米，底拱长15米，高4.15米。桥拱有5边，每边有6根条石，共30根条石，交接处采用横锁石。桥南侧横梁石上刻有“皇宋嘉定癸酉季秋闰月建造”，故可知该桥建于宋嘉定六年（1213年）。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8F%A4%E6%9C%88%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":91369550,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91369550","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/97530a714d3e5d30e3e37556.jpg","title":"Guyue_Bridge_05_2022-02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guyue_Bridge_05_2022-02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/Guyue_Bridge_05_2022-02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​义乌古月桥，南面。","width":320,"height":213}}